## Common Troubleshooting

### Issue: No logs are showing
```bash
# Check if journal is running
systemctl status systemd-journald

# Check disk space
df -h /var/log/journal

# Re-enable persistent journal
sudo mkdir -p /var/log/journal
sudo systemctl restart systemd-journald
```

### Issue: Logs missing after reboot
```bash
# Ensure persistent storage
sudo journalctl --flush

# Check configuration
grep -E "Storage|SystemMaxUse" /etc/systemd/journald.conf
```

### Issue: High disk usage
```bash
# Check usage
journalctl --disk-usage

# Reduce immediately
sudo journalctl --vacuum-size=100M

# Set permanent limit in config
sudo vim /etc/systemd/journald.conf
# Add: SystemMaxUse=1G
```

